Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Home: show the WiFi network beside the main button's icon

Headunit Server only: the network this unit is on, its band and signal,
or that WiFi is off or not connected. A tap on the icon or the line asks
Android for one WiFi scan (or to turn WiFi on), a long press opens the
WiFi settings. The line updates while the home is on screen.

